WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.651 --> 00:00:18.425
&gt;&gt;THE BROWARD COUNTY SHERIFF'S

00:00:14.221 --> 00:00:20.861
OFFICE SAID NICOLAS CRUZ HAD AN

00:00:18.558 --> 00:00:24.264
AR-15 IN HIS POSSESSION.

00:00:20.994 --> 00:00:28.969
IT'S BEEN USED IN MASS SHOOTINGS

00:00:24.398 --> 00:00:30.570
IN AURORA, COLORADO,

00:00:29.102 --> 00:00:30.871
CONNECTICUT, TEXAS, AND LAS

00:00:30.704 --> 00:00:33.607
VEGAS.

00:00:31.004 --> 00:00:37.644
&gt;&gt;  THIS HAPPENS NOWHERE ELSE

00:00:33.740 --> 00:00:42.716
OTHER THAN THE UNITED STATES OF

00:00:37.778 --> 00:00:44.685
AMERICA, THIS EPIDEMIC OF MASS

00:00:42.850 --> 00:00:47.254
SLAUGHTER, THIS SCOURGE OF

00:00:44.818 --> 00:00:47.821
SCHOOL SHOOTING AFTER SCHOOL

00:00:47.388 --> 00:00:50.424
SHOOTING.

00:00:47.955 --> 00:00:53.927
IT ONLY HAPPENS HERE, NOT

00:00:50.557 --> 00:00:57.264
BECAUSE OF COINCIDENCE, NOT

00:00:54.061 --> 00:01:00.868
BECAUSE OF BAD LUCK, BUT AS A

00:00:57.398 --> 00:01:03.037
CONSEQUENCE OF OUR INACTION.

00:01:03.170 --> 00:01:06.740
&gt;&gt;  IT DIDN'T TAKE HIM LONG TO

00:01:04.938 --> 00:01:08.442
GO RIGHT TO GUN CONTROL.

00:01:06.874 --> 00:01:09.877
CHRIS MURPHY FROM CONNECTICUT.

00:01:08.576 --> 00:01:12.279
THIS A PROBLEM WITH THE GUN OR

00:01:10.010 --> 00:01:15.049
THE SHOOTER?

00:01:12.413 --> 00:01:16.784
LET'S LOOK AT THE AR-15, WHAT

00:01:16.917 --> 00:01:21.622
MAKES IT SO SAFE AND WHAT IT

00:01:19.720 --> 00:01:23.490
TAKES TO GET ONE.

00:01:21.755 --> 00:01:23.791
AARON, YOU KNOW THIS WEAPON

00:01:23.624 --> 00:01:25.559
WELL.

00:01:23.924 --> 00:01:28.262
I'VE FIRED IT MANY TIMES.

00:01:25.693 --> 00:01:29.964
MY FAMILY OWNED A LOT OF GUNS.

00:01:28.396 --> 00:01:31.399
I SHOT GUNS SINCE I WAS, I DON'T

00:01:30.097 --> 00:01:33.968
KNOW, 6 YEARS OLD.

00:01:31.532 --> 00:01:35.870
IT'S LIKE ALL WEAPONS.

00:01:34.101 --> 00:01:38.306
IT'S VERY DANGEROUS IN THE HANDS

00:01:36.003 --> 00:01:42.209
OF THE WRONG PERSON AND IF

00:01:38.439 --> 00:01:44.545
YOU'RE NOT TRAINED AND YOU HAVE

00:01:42.343 --> 00:01:47.548
HAVE A CRIMINAL DISPOSITION, A

00:01:44.679 --> 00:01:49.617
VIOLENT DISPOSITION, IT CAN BE

00:01:47.682 --> 00:01:51.285
TURNED INTO A KILLING MACHINE.

00:01:49.750 --> 00:01:53.521
CHRIS MURPHY WANTS TO MAKE THIS

00:01:51.419 --> 00:01:56.557
ALL ABOUT THE WEAPONS.

00:01:53.654 --> 00:01:57.925
&gt;&gt;  HE ISN'T REALLY QUALIFIED TO

00:01:56.691 --> 00:01:58.893
ASSESS THREAT AND MANAGE RISK.

00:01:58.059 --> 00:02:01.029
THIS IS A SECURITY ISSUE.

00:01:59.027 --> 00:02:02.497
IT'S NOT A WEAPON ISSUE.

00:02:01.162 --> 00:02:04.065
THAT KID HAD PARENTS.

00:02:02.630 --> 00:02:05.533
WHERE'S THE PARENTS?

00:02:04.198 --> 00:02:07.635
WHO RAISED THIS KID?

00:02:05.667 --> 00:02:09.404
WHAT WAS GOING ON IN THE HOUSE?

00:02:07.769 --> 00:02:10.371
THAT'S THE FIRST PLACE I WOULD

00:02:09.537 --> 00:02:13.608
BE LOOKING.

00:02:10.505 --> 00:02:15.610
PARDON ME FOR MY VOICE.

00:02:13.742 --> 00:02:16.711
THERE IS A MENTAL HEALTH

00:02:15.744 --> 00:02:19.047
EPIDEMIC HERE THAT'S BEING

00:02:16.845 --> 00:02:21.516
CONFUSED WITH A GUN PROBLEM.

00:02:19.180 --> 00:02:24.352
YOUR LAST GUEST TALKED ABOUT HOW

00:02:21.649 --> 00:02:26.688
ISRAEL MANAGED TO COMPLETELY

00:02:24.486 --> 00:02:31.192
SQUASH ALL OF THE SCHOOL

00:02:26.821 --> 00:02:33.128
SHOOTINGS IN THE '70S AS A

00:02:31.326 --> 00:02:35.730
RESULT OF TERRORISM.

00:02:33.261 --> 00:02:41.603
THE WEAPON, JUST TO GO BACK TO

00:02:35.864 --> 00:02:44.873
YOUR FIRST POINT, THE AR DOESN'T

00:02:41.736 --> 00:02:46.908
STAND FOR AUTOMATIC RIFLE.

00:02:45.006 --> 00:02:47.876
IT'S THE COMPANY THAT

00:02:47.042 --> 00:02:48.810
MANUFACTURED IT FOR THE

00:02:48.009 --> 00:02:52.380
MILITARY.

00:02:48.943 --> 00:02:53.682
NOW THERE'S DOZENS IF NOT

00:02:52.514 --> 00:02:57.152
HUNDREDS OF COMPANIES THAT

00:02:53.815 --> 00:02:59.621
MANUFACTURE THEM AND SELL THEM.

00:02:57.285 --> 00:03:01.823
IT'S SEMIAUTOMATIC.

00:02:59.754 --> 00:03:02.190
IT'S NO DIFFERENT THAN A

00:03:01.956 --> 00:03:04.826
HANDGUN.

00:03:02.324 --> 00:03:05.760
IN FACT, THE ROUND IS EVEN

00:03:04.959 --> 00:03:08.296
SMALLER.

00:03:05.894 --> 00:03:10.365
IT'S A 22-CALIBER ROUND IF YOU

00:03:08.430 --> 00:03:11.866
WERE TO BREAK YOU THE DOWN.

00:03:10.498 --> 00:03:13.968
THE OTHER DIFFERENCE IS IT

00:03:14.102 --> 00:03:18.173
LEGALLY PURCHASED TO FIRE

00:03:15.804 --> 00:03:21.710
WITHOUT A FEDERAL FIREARMS

00:03:18.306 --> 00:03:28.917
LICENSE ON FULLY AUTOMATIC.

00:03:21.843 --> 00:03:32.154
THE M4, WHICH THE AR IS MODELED

00:03:29.050 --> 00:03:35.390
AFTER, IS A FULLY AUTOMATIC

00:03:32.287 --> 00:03:36.992
RIFLE FOR FULLY AUTOMATIC FIRE.

00:03:35.524 --> 00:03:38.393
I THINK THERE IS SOME

00:03:37.125 --> 00:03:40.028
GRANDIOSITY AFTER BEING AT WAR

00:03:38.527 --> 00:03:41.229
FOR THE LAST 15 YEARS, WHICH

00:03:40.162 --> 00:03:42.431
MAKES KIDS AND PEOPLE WANT TO

00:03:41.363 --> 00:03:47.169
ASSOCIATE WITH THIS WEAPON.

00:03:42.564 --> 00:03:48.637
BUT THE FACT IS IT LOOKS LIKE A

00:03:47.302 --> 00:03:50.505
MENACING M4.

00:03:48.770 --> 00:03:55.711
NOT EVEN CLOSE.

00:03:50.639 --> 00:03:59.147
&gt;&gt;  IT'S A SEMIAUTO WEAPON, BUT

00:03:55.844 --> 00:04:01.083
THE MAGAZINES, THE CLIPS CAN

00:03:59.281 --> 00:04:02.751
HOLD MORE BULLETS.

00:04:01.216 --> 00:04:03.952
SO THAT'S WHAT THE -- CHRIS

00:04:02.884 --> 00:04:06.388
MURPHY WILL SAY.

00:04:04.086 --> 00:04:06.788
IT'S NOT JUST THE WAY THE WEAPON

00:04:06.522 --> 00:04:09.625
LOOKS.

00:04:06.922 --> 00:04:10.792
IT'S THE FACT THAT THE CLIP

00:04:09.758 --> 00:04:13.529
HOLDS MANY BULLETS.

00:04:10.926 --> 00:04:14.596
HE HAD A LOT OF CLIPS IN HIS

00:04:13.662 --> 00:04:16.165
POSSESSION APPARENTLY.

00:04:14.730 --> 00:04:17.633
BUT IT'S A POPULAR WEAPON.

00:04:16.298 --> 00:04:19.768
&gt;&gt;  IT'S ALL OVER THE COUNTRY

00:04:17.766 --> 00:04:20.302
BECAUSE IT'S A REALLY GOOD

00:04:19.902 --> 00:04:22.604
SELF-DEFENSE WEAPON.

00:04:20.435 --> 00:04:23.505
I WOULD HAVE ONE IN MY HOME FOR

00:04:22.738 --> 00:04:25.107
HOME DEFENSE.

00:04:23.639 --> 00:04:26.942
THOUSANDS OF PEOPLE HAVE THEM IN

00:04:25.241 --> 00:04:27.810
THEIR HOME BECAUSE IT SHOOTS

00:04:27.076 --> 00:04:30.179
VERY STRAIGHT.

00:04:27.943 --> 00:04:30.546
YOU CAN CARRY MORE AMMUNITION IN

00:04:30.312 --> 00:04:32.815
IT.

00:04:30.679 --> 00:04:34.183
AND IT'S ACTUALLY SAFER BECAUSE

00:04:32.948 --> 00:04:37.253
YOU'RE GOING TO A LOWER -- YOU

00:04:34.316 --> 00:04:40.890
HAVE TO PARDON ME.

00:04:37.386 --> 00:04:41.791
YOU HAVE A LESS LIKELIHOOD OF

00:04:41.023 --> 00:04:43.859
SPORADIC FIRE OR HITTING

00:04:41.924 --> 00:04:45.394
INNOCENT PEOPLE IF YOU'RE USING

00:04:43.993 --> 00:04:46.428
IT FOR HOME DEFENSE BECAUSE IT

00:04:45.528 --> 00:04:47.963
SHOOTS REALLY STRAIGHT.

00:04:46.562 --> 00:04:48.297
IT'S ACTUALLY A VERY SAFE

00:04:48.097 --> 00:04:50.266
WEAPON.

00:04:48.430 --> 00:04:50.666
IT'S EASIER TO SHOOT THAN A

00:04:50.399 --> 00:04:52.568
PISTOL.

00:04:50.800 --> 00:04:53.669
IT'S GOT MORE POINTS OF CONTACT

00:04:52.701 --> 00:04:55.037
FOR STABILITY.

00:04:53.803 --> 00:04:57.139
IN THE HANDS OF THE WRONG PERSON

00:04:55.171 --> 00:04:57.473
-- AND AGAIN, WHERE WAS THE

00:04:57.273 --> 00:04:59.208
PARENTS?

00:04:57.606 --> 00:05:00.743
WHAT WAS THE HOME LIFE OF THIS

00:04:59.341 --> 00:05:02.311
CHILD?

00:05:00.876 --> 00:05:03.979
THERE'S SO MUCH MORE INVOLVED

00:05:02.444 --> 00:05:05.648
HERE THAN THE WEAPON.

00:05:04.113 --> 00:05:05.981
&gt;&gt;  THERE ARE SOME THINGS WE

00:05:05.781 --> 00:05:07.316
LEARNED.

00:05:06.115 --> 00:05:08.651
HIS MOTHER DIED LAST YEAR.

00:05:07.449 --> 00:05:15.291
HE WAS ADOPTED.

00:05:08.784 --> 00:05:15.591
HIS PARENTS, LINDA AND ROGER

00:05:15.424 --> 00:05:21.263
CRUZ.

00:05:15.725 --> 00:05:22.832
HE'S FOLLOWED THE IRAQI FIGHTERS

00:05:21.397 --> 00:05:26.636
ONLY AND THE SYRIAN RESISTANCE.

00:05:22.965 --> 00:05:28.104
WE DON'T KNOW MORE, BUT THERE'S

00:05:26.769 --> 00:05:29.305
SOMETHING GOING ON THERE.

00:05:28.237 --> 00:05:32.008
WE'LL LEARN MORE ABOUT THAT.

00:05:29.439 --> 00:05:34.911
ONE MORE QUESTION FOR YOU, GIVEN

00:05:32.141 --> 00:05:37.714
YOUR EXPERIENCE WITH ISRAEL AND

00:05:35.044 --> 00:05:40.116
THE SCHOOLS, WHAT COULD THESE

00:05:37.847 --> 00:05:41.117
SCHOOLS IN THE UNITED STATES DO

00:05:40.250 --> 00:05:43.953
TODAY BEYOND HAVING ONE SECURITY

00:05:41.251 --> 00:05:45.355
GUARD AND A BUZZER AND SOME

00:05:44.087 --> 00:05:46.756
BULLETPROOF GLASS IN THE FRONT,

00:05:45.488 --> 00:05:48.524
WHAT ELSE COULD THEY DO?

00:05:46.889 --> 00:05:50.994
&gt;&gt;  THANK YOU FOR ASKING ME THIS

00:05:48.658 --> 00:05:52.996
IMPORTANT QUESTION.

00:05:51.127 --> 00:05:53.896
THE DIFFERENCE BETWEEN ISRAELI

00:05:53.129 --> 00:05:55.732
SECURITY AND AMERICAN PRIVATE

00:05:54.030 --> 00:05:56.599
SECURITY IS THAT WE INVEST IN A

00:05:55.865 --> 00:05:58.234
SECURITY GUARD.

00:05:56.733 --> 00:06:00.370
WE PHYSICALLY TRAIN THEM TO BE

00:05:58.368 --> 00:06:03.673
ABLE TO LOOK AT BEHAVIOR TO

00:06:00.503 --> 00:06:05.809
PREDICT VIOLENCE, WHICH MEANS

00:06:03.806 --> 00:06:08.511
THE AVERAGE SECURITY GUARD IS

00:06:05.942 --> 00:06:10.447
TRAINED IN BEING ABLE TO RESPOND

00:06:08.645 --> 00:06:13.516
TO AN ACTIVE SHOOTER, WHICH

00:06:10.580 --> 00:06:14.551
MEANS THEY'RE ARMED IN THE

00:06:13.650 --> 00:06:15.952
SCHOOLS.

00:06:14.684 --> 00:06:16.953
TWO, OPEN THE JACKET AND CHECK

00:06:16.086 --> 00:06:19.155
THE BAG.

00:06:17.087 --> 00:06:22.859
YOU'RE NOT GETTING IN WITH AN

00:06:19.289 --> 00:06:26.196
AR, A PISTOL, A BOMB.

00:06:22.993 --> 00:06:29.099
IT WORKS FOR ANY KID WHO'S

00:06:26.329 --> 00:06:29.499
POORLY RAISED AND IT WORKS FOR

00:06:29.232 --> 00:06:31.735
TERRORISTS.

00:06:29.633 --> 00:06:33.236
SO WE CHECK THE BAGS, OPEN THE

00:06:31.868 --> 00:06:33.703
JACKETS, BUT WE TRAIN THE

00:06:33.370 --> 00:06:36.172
SECURITY.

00:06:33.837 --> 00:06:38.108
WE INVEST IN THE INDIVIDUAL

00:06:36.306 --> 00:06:38.642
SECURITY GUARD SO HE CAN PREDICT

00:06:38.241 --> 00:06:40.477
BEHAVIOR.

00:06:38.775 --> 00:06:41.578
THERE'S 21 DIFFERENT RED FLAGS

00:06:40.610 --> 00:06:43.213
SOMEONE'S GOING TO DO WHEN

00:06:41.711 --> 00:06:43.713
THEY'RE ABOUT TO COMMIT AN ACT

00:06:43.346 --> 00:06:45.448
OF MURDER.

